7", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031330_963175395511870_7978644723259750955_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=v5ldlZ_6s1IQ7kNvwHgS6jQ&_nc_oc=AdkdyUP0Mq2AOfn7xR-b4qBAj9S-fcxiKZ5mZwGBvgtFeDWAkgJ88ujr08di678JF8Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afu87_RuOj0A141VRuInCg9xxic5idT5Vl1CWd_Qbg7ckw&oe=699C6703"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "output-onlinepngtools (17).png", "id": "1440690073248478", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982522_1440690076581811_5977182681337588250_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xqU9VyvzlQUQ7kNvwHKfMWe&_nc_oc=Adl1fzoQzP6yu6rmJhZYTeAwz8zNzsToEgvOukNruqSdfTiO-oApb9XOptgoJmDgbNY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afsz08Rr4PrLqJ3bZGp5FcfGvz-HUKcrNUVU1V46yv7cVg&oe=699C42C8"}, "display_name": "Funny Little Monkeys", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Embark on a wild, gravity-defying adventure in Funny Little Monkeys, the ultimate fan game inspired by the heart-pounding action of Gorilla Tag. Swing through towering urban jungles, dodge obstacles, and outmaneuver your opponents as you navigate a vibrant, neon-lit cityscape. With intuitive controls and exhilarating gameplay, team up with friends or go solo in this adrenaline-fueled race to the top of the leaderboard. Are you ready to unleash your inner primate and become the king of the concrete jungle?", "short_description": "Enter the neon-lit frenzy of Funny Little Monkeys, a thrilling fan game spun from the high-flying antics of Gorilla Tag. Scale towering cityscapes, swing past obstacles, and outsmart rivals in this adrenaline-charged race. With slick controls and multiplayer mayhem, it's a jungle out there\u2014will you rise to the top?"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.termsfeed.com/live/74c36ae2-e47c-4a1c-a5cc-573745812305", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Skibidi Stu